Implement TelescopeON command orchestration using TANGO Controls.

Requirements:
- TelescopeON is invoked on MonitoringDevice
- MonitoringDevice invokes TelescopeON on Device2 and Device3 using DeviceProxy
- Wait for ResultCode from all devices
- Return OK only if all devices return ResultCode.OK
- Return FAILED if any device fails or times out
- Add logging, exception handling, and timeout handling
- Generate production-style TANGO Python implementation